{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're kidding me."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The intensity of these attacks really ",
                "make it feel like an <i$extra> incident started."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So just defeating that Ariya",
                "wasn't enough to resolve everything."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ariya?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? And who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's Ariya?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, I'm a shellfish youkai.",
                "So, about this Ariya..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ariya is the god of",
                "the shrine up ahead."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I defeated her."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You defeated her? For real?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You seem like a",
                "dangerous human, huh."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For some reason, that information",
                "doesn't come up in my truths..."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's because the forces of darkness",
                "are hiding it!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Which means you are the enemy!",
                "Die for the sake of the <i$truth>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What truth?",
                "You're just believing a bunch of silliness."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Silliness?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'd have to bring Ariya to her."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, what do you say?",
                "Why don't you come to the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But... the surface is contaminated with <i$chemtrails>.",
                "It's supposed to be uninhabitable."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't be an idiot.",
                "Stop believing that foolishness."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, not that I can talk...",
                "I'm only here to amuse that oni from Hell."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's try to live",
                "a little more carefree, huh."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But, the surface is, well..."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The thing is,",
                "I'm just a fossil from this place."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What I wanted to say is,",
                "I've never been outside before, so..."
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you talking about?",
                "You lost to me."
            ]
        },
        "162_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't get to refuse.",
                "That's the one and only truth."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you seem more interesting than that."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That oni from Hell told me that,",
                "if I want to keep using the Incident Stone,"
            ]
        }
    }
}